==== hyperbricks yaml {!{overwrite_query_test}} ====
overwrite_query_test:
  - type: api_render
  - route: status_code_test
  - endpoint: http://localhost:8090/echo/query
  - method: GET
  - querykeys:
      - example
  - queryparams:
      otherexample: TEST_OVERWRITTEN
  - inline: |
      {{.Data.queryParams.otherexample}}
==== expected output ====
TEST_OVERWRITTEN
